"No recorded intake/sleep or no usable target." = "没有摄入／睡眠记录，或缺少有效目标。";

"Solid blue means actual sleep reaches your saved nightly target. Awake and time in bed are excluded. Deep and REM are references, not scoring targets." = "实际睡眠时长达到当晚保存的目标，才显示实蓝。清醒和卧床时间不计入；深睡和 REM 仅供参考，不参与判定。";

"Solid yellow requires all three daily macro targets. The lower end of the carb/fat ranges is the completion threshold; the upper end is guidance, not a reason to eat extra." = "蛋白质、碳水和脂肪都达到当天目标，才显示实黄。碳水／脂肪范围的下限用于判断达标，上限是建议，不鼓励额外摄入。";

"Color bands are Masso's display rules, not medical thresholds. Today has a white outline. Home's oldest three dots also fade for layout." = "颜色档位是 Masso 的展示规则，不是医学阈值。今天用白色圆环标记；首页最左侧三天还有额外的视觉淡出。";

"Completion = actual sleep minutes ÷ that night's target. Values above the target earn no extra credit. Stage estimates do not determine the color." = "完成度＝实际睡眠分钟数÷当晚目标。超过目标不额外加分，睡眠阶段估算不决定颜色。";

"The daily Diet score compares protein, carbs and fat with fixed daily targets (weights 20/10/5); each macro is capped at 100%, so extra intake cannot offset another shortfall. Meal cards show that meal's weighted contribution to the full daily targets as a percentage, not a score." = "每日饮食评分按蛋白质、碳水和脂肪的固定日目标计算（权重为 20/10/5）；每项最高计 100%，多余摄入不能抵消其他营养素的不足。每餐卡片则显示本餐对全天目标的加权贡献百分比，不是评分。";

"Only saved meal records count. AI nutrition estimates can be inaccurate; colors measure recorded target adherence, not diet quality or health." = "仅保存后的餐食计入。AI 营养估算可能有误差；颜色表示已记录摄入的目标达成度，不代表饮食质量或健康程度。";

"Saved historical targets take priority. If a day has no saved target, the current target is used; changing today's goal does not overwrite saved goals." = "优先采用当天保存的目标；没有历史目标时采用当前目标。修改今天的目标不会覆盖已保存的历史目标。";

"Adults generally need 7–9 hours; ages 13–18 need 8–10 hours and ages 6–12 need 9–12 hours. Eight hours is an adult starting point. A blue dot only confirms your chosen goal, not that your sleep is healthy." = "成人通常需要 7–9 小时；13–18 岁通常需要 8–10 小时，6–12 岁需要 9–12 小时。8 小时是成人的起点。蓝色仅表示达到你设置的目标，不代表睡眠健康评估。";

"ISSN supports about 1.4–2.0 g/kg/day of protein for most healthy exercising adults. Masso's targets are planning starting points. Its 20/10/5 weights and color bands are product choices, not research-validated health scores." = "ISSN 建议多数健康成人运动人群每天约摄入 1.4–2.0g／kg 蛋白质。Masso 的目标是规划起点；20／10／5 权重及颜色档位是产品设定，不是经研究验证的健康评分。";

