"Your goal is weekly. Rest days do not count as failed daily goals." = "目标按周计算，休息日不代表未达标。";

"Green means at least one recorded training set that day." = "绿色表示当天至少记录了一组训练。";

"Gray means no recorded training sets that day." = "灰色表示当天没有训练组记录。";

"The first day after a workout." = "训练后的第 1 天。";

