"Gray appears after the two-day recovery window when there is no workout." = "训练后两天恢复期结束且当天无训练时显示灰色。";

"Recovery colors are for context and do not count toward your weekly target. Today has a white outline; the oldest three home dots fade for display only." = "恢复色仅供参考，不计入周目标。今天有白色描边；首页最早三天淡化仅为视觉处理。";

"Each day with recorded training sets counts once, even if you complete several workouts. This week's count follows your calendar settings and is compared with your current weekly target." = "有训练组记录的日期计为一天，同一天多次训练只计一次。本周按你的日历设置统计，并与当前每周目标比较。";

"Only logged workout days count toward your weekly target. The two recovery shades are a simple display rule, not a measurement of muscle recovery or workout intensity." = "只有有训练记录的日期计入周目标。训练后两天的恢复色仅作参考，不代表实际肌肉恢复或训练强度。";

"Why this target?" = "为什么设置这个目标？";

"Your fixed gram targets use the weight, training goal and weekly training frequency saved in Masso. If you are 65 or older, the protein factor is raised modestly. Meal count only divides the daily targets; it does not change them." = "固定克数目标根据你在 Masso 保存的体重、训练目标和每周训练天数计算。65 岁及以上会适度提高蛋白质系数。餐数只影响每餐分配，不改变全天目标。";

"Carbohydrate uses your goal and planned training days, with a 130 g adult reference floor. Fat uses a simple 0.8 g/kg planning value. These are practical estimates, not measured calorie needs or medical prescriptions." = "碳水按训练目标和计划训练天数计算，并设有成人每日 130 克的参考下限。脂肪按每公斤体重 0.8 克估算。这些是实用规划值，不是测得的热量需求或医疗处方。";

"Masso does not currently collect height or body composition, so it cannot estimate energy needs precisely. Sleep duration is not used to change macro grams because there is no established formula for doing that." = "Masso 目前没有收集身高或体脂组成，因此无法精确估算能量需求。睡眠时长也不会用于调整营养素克数，因为目前没有可靠的换算公式。";

"ISSN describes protein needs as a range, not one proven ideal for every person. Masso selects a fixed planning point from body weight and training goal; carbohydrates also reflect planned weekly training days, and fat uses a simple weight-based estimate. Age modestly raises the protein factor from 65 onward. Height, body composition, medical conditions and reliable daily energy expenditure are not collected, so these values are estimates rather than a personalized clinical prescription. Sleep data is not used to change macro targets because there is no established conversion from sleep duration to daily macro grams. Scoring weights and color bands are product choices, not research-validated health scores." = "ISSN 将蛋白质需求描述为一个范围，并没有证实适用于所有人的单一最佳值。Masso 根据体重和训练目标选取固定规划值；碳水也参考每周计划训练天数，脂肪则按体重估算。65 岁起适度提高蛋白质系数。由于目前没有收集身高、体脂组成、健康状况或可靠的每日能量消耗，这些数值属于估算，不是个人医疗处方。睡眠时长没有公认的换算方式，因此不会用于调整宏量营养素目标。评分权重和颜色分级是产品规则，不是经研究验证的健康评分。";

