"Carbs follow logged workouts and working sets. Training/rest offsets use 0.5 g/kg around your weekly average; high-volume days add 0.3 g/kg. The change is limited to 50 g either way, with a 130 g floor. These are Masso planning rules, not exact doses from a study." = "碳水根据实际训练和完成的组数调整。训练与非训练日以每千克体重 0.5 克围绕周平均目标调节；训练量较大时额外增加每千克 0.3 克。每日增减最多 50 克，目标不低于 130 克。这是 Masso 的保守规划规则，并非研究给出的精确剂量。";

